  (text "C3 header: PCH J5 -> UPS 2x4; UPS_5V + UPS_3V3 + I2C_SDA/SCL + GND"
    (at 20.32 146.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "752a3b39-b164-41aa-8fc4-653a2d5cb417"))
  (text "C4 12.6 V: UPS XH2.54 -> PCH J7; UPS_12V6 + GND"
    (at 20.32 150.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "2f71ec05-6562-4420-9cff-6866b4ff52d2"))
  (text "The 16 mm switch drives the UPS switch input through the PCH; its LED is fed from UPS_5V via R1."
    (at 20.32 172.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "75607315-e804-533b-b665-2c43db92601f"))
  (text "No fuse on the PCH; the Module 3S protects the pack. CHG_SENSE taps the unswitched input."
    (at 20.32 178.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "19192ffe-0232-5fba-b564-a2d3e26db6fe"))
  (text "UPS_5V reaches the Pi through the supplied USB-C cable; it is the only supply."
    (at 20.32 184.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "4ac0a306-058b-5928-98cb-1f690c4882b7"))
  (text "J3 colours: C green, NO white, LED+ red, LED- black."
    (at 20.32 190.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "6a8ab1fa-a774-51ad-acd0-07058887537b"))
  (text "J16 is the PCH. UPS_3V3 is now wired to the UPS header; its host side and the J8 12.6 V aux are unused; 3.3 V stays the FireBeetle's."
    (at 20.32 196.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4291d4c-7a0b-41e1-9575-b0a8f93a47ae"))
